    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<table cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:1229px\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:1px solid #dddddd; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:1px solid #dddddd\">\n\t\t\t<div>期中考</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:1px solid #dddddd\">\n\t\t\t<div>20%</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:1px solid #dddddd\">\n\t\t\t<div>期中評量</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:1px solid #dddddd; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>期末考</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>20%</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>期末評量</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:1px solid #dddddd; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>平時</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>50%</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>平時考核 In-class evaluation: 40% (class quizzes, assignment, attendance, participation, learning attitude etc. ) + Xreading 10%,</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:1px solid #dddddd; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>Post-test</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>10%</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:1px solid #dddddd; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div><strong>總計</strong></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div><strong>100%</strong></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; border-left:none; border-right:1px solid #dddddd; border-top:none\">\n\t\t\t<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected duration.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n4. Please purchase original textbook, following intellectual property law. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。\n5. The texts and exercises will be completed in class. Please bring textbooks to class. 請上課攜帶課本，以利上課活動使用。\n6.  Final Exam Policy: Students who need to retake the exam must apply within 3 days after the exam date, according to school regulations. Students who are absent on the exam day and do not apply for a make-up exam will receive a score of zero for the final exam. If the student’s reason for taking leave complies with school regulations, the make-up exam score will be based on the actual performance; if not, it will be reduced by 20%.期末考試規定：學生若需補考，必須於考試後 3 天內依學校規定提出申請。未於考試當日到場，且未申請補考者，其期末考成績以零分計算。若學生考試請假原由符合學校規定, 補考成績依實際成績計算; 若不合, 則打8折.\n7. Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。\n8.The extensive reading grade will be primarily based on the cumulative word count recorded by the Xreading system, accounting for 10% of the total course grade. For the high-intermediate level class, the target word count for the entire semester is 80,000 words. If a student exceeds the target by 10,000 words at the end of the semester, 1 bonus point will be added to the final grade, with a maximum of 5 bonus points allowed. Students may also consult with the instructor to conduct extensive reading through alternative methods, provided that the approach aligns with the principles of extensive reading and includes verifiable evidence of reading.本課程廣泛閱讀的評分將主要依據Xreading系統所累進的字數而定，並且佔\n總成績10%。中高級班全學期目標字數為80,000字，若學期末超過目標字數10,000字，得以加總成績1分，至多以加到5分為原則。學生可與授課教師協調，以其他方式進行廣泛閱讀、檢核其學習成效，但進行方式須符合廣泛閱讀之精神並有客觀閱讀之事實。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behavior in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data.學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。</div>\n\n<div>Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism.抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。</div>\n\n<div>Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating.考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
